1
00:00:00,417 --> 00:00:01,668
Why are you leaving?

2
00:00:01,668 --> 00:00:03,670
What on earth is going on?

3
00:00:03,878 --> 00:00:05,005
It just happened that way.

4
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:05,930
Will you just think

5
00:00:05,931 --> 00:00:06,756
it over one more time?

6
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:09,015
You haven't worked here long

7
00:00:09,016 --> 00:00:10,677
enough to be recognized.

8
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:12,220
I know.

9
00:00:12,804 --> 00:00:14,514
But I don't care anymore.

10
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:15,724
What?

11
00:00:15,724 --> 00:00:17,684
You're acting a bit strange.

12
00:00:17,684 --> 00:00:19,007
Didn't you go through

13
00:00:19,008 --> 00:00:20,478
a lot to get this job?

14
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:21,392
And now you're just

15
00:00:21,393 --> 00:00:22,439
going to give up?

16
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:25,567
Is this about the director?

17
00:00:27,652 --> 00:00:29,242
I saw everything this morning

18
00:00:29,243 --> 00:00:30,905
you talking with him.

19
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:31,698
Oh, that.

20
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:33,366
I was just passing by and...

21
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,143
He doesn't talk to the newbies

22
00:00:35,144 --> 00:00:36,828
so what's the deal?

23
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:37,744
Did he ask you

24
00:00:37,745 --> 00:00:38,913
to do something?

25
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:40,151
Since he can't do

26
00:00:40,152 --> 00:00:40,832
the presentation

27
00:00:40,832 --> 00:00:41,645
he probably asked

28
00:00:41,646 --> 00:00:42,625
you for the content, right?

29
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:43,626
No, that's not it.

30
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:45,086
Oh, really?

31
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:46,551
Then I should tell your team

32
00:00:46,552 --> 00:00:48,089
leader about what I saw today.

33
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:49,591
No, don't do that.

34
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:53,511
What's up with that guy?

35
00:00:54,971 --> 00:00:56,189
Are you really going to leave?

36
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:57,223
Without confronting him?

37
00:00:57,557 --> 00:00:59,013
Leaving is the best option

38
00:00:59,014 --> 00:01:00,602
for everyone.

39
00:01:02,353 --> 00:01:03,728
You really do like

40
00:01:03,729 --> 00:01:05,315
your team leader, don't you?

41
00:01:08,026 --> 00:01:09,243
Seeing how you're acting

42
00:01:09,244 --> 00:01:10,987
you must like her.

43
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,948
Whatever.

44
00:01:13,948 --> 00:01:16,034
What's the point now?

45
00:01:17,035 --> 00:01:19,037
So, where are you headed?

46
00:01:19,287 --> 00:01:20,703
To the academy I worked at

47
00:01:20,704 --> 00:01:22,540
to think things over.

48
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:24,501
Alright.

49
00:01:25,126 --> 00:01:27,962
Take care, wherever you go.
